## Summary

Implemented **`DET.APP.PERSISTENT_CHROME`** as a deterministic route-crawl check for app/desktop shells whose contract promises persistent chrome.

### What changed

**1. `design-rules/deterministic/generated/det-app-persistent-chrome.check.js`**

Replaced the stub with:

- **Contract gate** — runs only when persistence is promised via `data-shell-persistent`, `data-persistent-chrome`, `data-route-contract` containing “persistent”, `data-shell-regions` / `data-shell-region`, `data-ks-type="desktop-interface"`, or known app-shell body classes.
- **Per-page fingerprint** — `header`, `nav`, `aside`, `footer`, and `[data-shell-region]` outside `main`: `id`, KS hash, sorted nav link text signature.
- **Route crawl** — module-scoped baseline per origin; later crawled URLs are diffed for missing regions, hash drift, and nav link-set drift.
- **Exports** — `rule`, `run`, `collectAppPersistentChromeReport`, `findingsFromAppPersistentChromeReport`, `diffPersistentChromeRegions`, `resetRouteCrawlStateForTests` (same pattern as focus-trap / ambient-z-index).

**2. `design-rules/blender/rule-mappings.js`**

Registered under `DETERMINISTIC_IMPLEMENTATIONS`:

| Field | Value |
|--------|--------|
| status | `implemented` |
| area | `informationArchitecture` |
| scoreDimension | `informationArchitecture` |
| priorityWeight | `8` |
| defaultSeverity | `warn` |

**3. `design-rules/registry.generated.json`**

`DET.APP.PERSISTENT_CHROME` is already `implemented` with matching metadata (re-run `blend-rules` to refresh `fingerprint` / `generatedAt`).

**4. `auditor-tests/det-app-persistent-chrome.test.js`**

Unit tests for region diff, finding mapping, no-op paths, and two-route crawl comparison.

### Why

The source rule requires **shell regions stable across routes when the contract promises persistence** — measurable by DOM fingerprints on chrome outside `main`, not by AI. Generic marketing/handbook pages without an app contract are skipped to avoid false positives.

### Verify locally

Shell was unavailable in this session. Please run:

```bash
cd /home/lzvyahin/Code/forgesdlc-kitchensink/tools/website-ux-auditor
